  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0004_1467b164caf6.png\" style=\"width:2.44028in;height:1.67986in\" /><br />Slope of <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Slope of <math><mi>B</mi><mi>I</mi></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Slope of <math><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br />Let, the slopes of <math><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> are <math><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> &amp; <math><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> respectively<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>91</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>57</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>91</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>57</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>57</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>91</mn></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>39</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>26</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>9</mn><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>⇒</mo><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> The equation of <math><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and the equation of <math><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>"
